    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wä dämani Jo-thɛp kä I-jëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë ci Je-kɔb ɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö te ro̱l I-jëp kɛ bɛl, cuɛ gaatkɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu mi la̱tdɛ nyuurä lɔrä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän cä jɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö tëë kɛ bɛl kä I-jëp. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ wiaa thi̱n kä wiaa kökɛ kɔn bɛl ti banɛ cam a /ci buɔth kɔn bi lɛ näk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn ɛnɔ, cu nɛy da̱ŋ wäl jiɛn kä dämani Jo-thɛp kä cukɛ ben kɛ ɣöö bikɛ bɛl ben kɔk kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ, Je-kɔb /ke̱nɛ gatman Jo-thɛp ni Ben-ya-min ja̱k kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, kɛ ɣöö luthɛ ɣöö dɔŋ bɛ tekɛ mi wä jɛ jek dup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, cu gaat I-thɛ-rɛl cu ben kɛɛl kɛ nɛy ti ŋuan kɔ̱kiɛn kɛ kui̱ ko̱kä bɛɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Jo-thɛp tëë thi̱n, jɛn ɛ kuäär wec ni kɛɛliw. Ɛ jɛn Jo-thɛp ɛn nëë ko̱k nɛy diaal kä jɛ, nɛy tëë bäk ni gua̱thni gööli. Kä min ci gaat gua̱n cop kä jɛ, cukɛ rɔ̱ goŋ nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɔ min ci Jo-thɛp kɛ nɛn, cuɛ kɛ ŋic, kuɛɛ la ɣöö cuɛ kɛ cieŋ ce̱tkɛ nɛy ti guä ti ji̱ rööl go̱lä kä cuɛ ruac kɛ kɛ ɛ yath yath, cuɛ kɛ thi̱ec i̱, “Yɛn bia ni kä?” Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Kɔn bakɔ ni ro̱o̱l Kɛ-naan kɛ ɣöö bakɔ ben kɔk bɛɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɔmɔ ɛ jɛn ŋi̱ec ëë ŋic Jo-thɛp ɛ ni dämani, duundɛ ɣöö /ke̱nkɛ jɛ kulɛ ŋic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn bendiɛn ɛmɔ, cu Jo-thɛp la̱k ëë cɛ läkikä kɛ kui̱diɛn cu tim. Kä cuɛ kɛ gɔny, wëë i̱, “Yɛn kɛ yɛn lieem. Bia kɛ ɣöö bia nyua̱n rööla ben lim.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “/Ci ɛ jɛn ɛnɔ, kuäär. Ɛ kök bɛɛl ɛ ni̱n no̱o̱ŋ kɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɔn diaal lakɔ gaat raam kɛl. /Ci ɛ kɔn lieem, kueckɔ ka̱ŋ nath.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ lɛni la̱r kɛ i̱, “/Ci ɛ jɛn, min no̱o̱ŋ yɛ ɛ ɣöö bia nyua̱n wec ben lim.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ŋot ni kɛ mi jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Kɔn kuäär, lapkɔ kuaanyku. Mëëdan kɛ kɔn gaat mään raam kɛl, kä lap kɔ wäl wi̱cda rɛw, gaat wutdä kɛl mi cieŋ ro̱o̱l in cɔal i̱ Kɛ-naan. Gat in tɔtdiɛn jɛn a kɛɛl kɛ gua̱a̱ra, kä gat kɛl cɛ thil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-thɛp kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛpuc ɛ ɣän i̱ kɛ yɛn lieem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ruacdun ba thuɔ̱kdɛ jek inɛ, ni kɛ ciöt kua̱r ni Pɛro, /ca yɛ bi nhök kac raar ɛn wanɛ ɛni mi wä dämuɔɔrun in tɔt wä ben ɛn wanɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi ram kɛl kä yɛ wä kä bɛ jɛ wä nööŋ, kä tha̱a̱ŋkun bikɛ duɔth due̱e̱l yi̱eenä ɛn wanɛ kɛ ɣöö ba ruacdun jek mi ɛ thuɔ̱k. Kä mi /cɛ bia thuɔ̱k, ni kɛ ciöt kua̱r ni Pɛro, yɛn lapɛ lieem.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ mɛmɛ thuk kɛ lat, cuɛ kɛn diaal la̱th luaak yi̱eenä kɛ pe̱k ni̱ni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn cäŋ in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn cu Jo-thɛp kɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän lapä ram mi luth Kuoth, la̱tdɛ nɛmɛ kɛ ɣöö bia tëk ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi lapɛ nɛy ti ji̱ thuɔ̱ɔ̱kni, a ram kɛl kä yɛ doth yi̱eenä guäthdun, kä bi tha̱a̱ŋkun wä nöŋkɛ ji̱ cieeŋnikun bɛl ti ba wä luäk ni buɔthdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ dämuɔɔrun in tɔt wä nöŋ ɣä. Inɔ bɛ cu jɔɔc ɛn ɣöö ruacdun ɛ thuɔ̱k, kä bia cu kään rɛy rikä.” Kä kɛn cukɛ mɛmɛ nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guäth ëë ruackɛ kamnikiɛn kärɔ̱, cukɛ wee i̱, “Kɔn ɛpuc ta̱nɛ kɛ duer kɛ kui̱ kä mëë canɛ lät kä dämandan, kɛ ɣöö mëë nɛ̈nɛ riɛk jiɛthä lɔaacdɛ, /ka̱nɛ ruacdɛ liŋ guäth ëë lipɛ kɔn. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ täämɛ ci riɛk ɛmɛ kɔn mom.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cu Rɛ-u-ben kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɣän /ka̱n yɛ jiök ɛn ɣöö /cuarɛ dho̱o̱l ɛmɔ lät kä mi jiääk, kä cuarɛ ruacdä lieŋdɛ lo̱k. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ täämɛ riɛmdɛ thieecɛ rɔɔdɛ pua̱nynikɔn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guäth in tekɛ ruac inɔ, /ke̱nkɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö Jo-thɛp cɛ min lat kɛn ɛ liŋ, kɛ ɣöö mëë ruackɛ kɛ jɛ tëë kɛ ram mi luc ruacdiɛn Jo-thɛp kɛ thok rööl I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Jo-thɛp ruacdiɛn ɛmɔ liŋ, cuɛ wä raar kä cuɛ wä wiee. Kä mëë ci lɔcdɛ kɔ̱a̱c, cuɛ luny kä kɛ. Cuɛ Cim-on kuany rɛydiɛn, cuɛ jɛ naŋ kä cuɛ jak kä yiankɛ nhiamdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ la̱a̱tkɛ cu la̱t ŋɔak ɛn ɣöö bikɛ cualikiɛn pik kɛ bɛl, kä ba ramɔ kä kɛ yio̱o̱kɛ la̱th thok cualä bɛɛlkɛ, kä ba kɛ moc mi̱th ti ba cam lɛɛr rɛy ja̱liɛn. Kä cua jɛ la̱t inɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loc dämani Jo-thɛp kä Kɛ-naan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
