        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci dämani thuɔ̱k kɛ mi yiankɛ bɛlkiɛn jio̱kni muɔ̱likiɛn, cukɛ jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë thiaŋ guäth ëë cikɛ wee lɔ̱ŋkɛ, cu ram kɛl kä kɛ cuaalɛ lɛp kɛ ɣöö de̱rɛ muulɛ moc mi̱eth, kä ɛn wa̱nɔ cuɛ yio̱o̱kɛ jek thok cuaalä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni̱n cɛ kɛ nɛn, cuɛ dämani jiök i̱, “Ca yio̱o̱kä luɔ̱c ɣä! Kɛn ti̱n, tekɛ thok cuaalädä.” Kä mëë cikɛ kɛ nɛn, cukɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈r, kä cuɛ kɛ kuer lath dualä mi di̱i̱t. Kä cukɛ rɔ̱ thiëc ɛ kɛn i̱, “Ɛŋu ɛ nɛ ci Kuoth ɛ lät kä kɔn ɛ?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ, mëë cikɛ cop dhɔɔriɛn rɛy rööl Kɛ-naan, cukɛ gua̱ndiɛn ni Je-kɔb la̱t ŋɔak diaal tëë ci tuɔɔk, larkɛ jɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛn wut indaan, min la kuäär rööl ɛmi, cɛ ruac kɛ kɔ ɛ jiäk, kä cɛ kɔ gɔany i̱ kɛ kɔn lieem kɛ kui̱ röölɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cakɔ jɛ kulɛ jiök i̱, ‘/Ci ɛ kɔn lieem, kɛ kɔn nɛy ti ji̱ thuɔ̱ɔ̱kni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cakɔ jɛ lɛni jiök bä, ‘Ɛ kɔn gaat wutdä kɛl kä gua̱a̱ra, kä lapkɔ gaat da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cda rɛw. Kɛl cɛ thil, kä gat in tɔt jɛn a cieŋ kɛɛl kɛ gua̱a̱ra ro̱o̱l in cɔal i̱ Kɛ-naan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛnɔ cu wut ɛmɔ min la kuäär rööl kɔ jiök i̱, ‘Bä thuɔ̱k lɔaacdun ŋa̱c inɛ. Yɛn bi ram kɛl kä yɛ duɔth kɛ ɣä kɛɛl, kä bia ji̱ cieeŋnikun kök bɛl ti bia wä luäk ni buɔthdiɛn, inɔ bia cu jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ bia dämuɔɔrun in tɔt cu wä nöŋ ɣä. Kɛ no̱o̱ŋdɛ bä cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö /ciɛ yɛn lieem, kä kɛ yɛn ji̱ thuɔ̱ɔ̱kni, kä bä dämuɔɔrun cu luɔ̱c yɛ, kä bia cu la kökɛ ɛn ro̱o̱l ɛ.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ ruac kɛ gua̱ndiɛn cukɛ cu wee ka̱mkɛ bɛl raar rɛy cuali, nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, cu ramɔ kä kɛ kith yio̱o̱nikɛ jek tëë thok cual bɛɛlkɛ. Kä mëë cikɛ yio̱w nɛn kɛn diaal a amäni gua̱ndiɛn cukɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱ndiɛn ni Je-kɔb kɛ jiök i̱, “Yɛn cia ɣä jak kä rɛɛt gan. Cä thil Jo-thɛp mi ŋot kä ɣä, kä thilɛ Cim-on mi ŋot kä ɣä. Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, täämɛ go̱rɛ mi bia Ben-ya-min naŋ bä. Kɛn ti̱ti̱ diaal dhiɛlkɛ ɣä ni piny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cu Rɛ-u-ben ɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋäth ɣä ɛn ɣöö bä Ben-ya-min tit kä bä jɛ nööŋ jɔk. Kä mi /ka̱n jɛ nyɔk kɛ no̱o̱ŋ, ji̱n bi gaatkä da̱ŋ rɛw näk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jiök ni jɛ i̱, “Gatdä /cɛ bi wä kɛɛl kɛ yɛ, kɛ ɣöö gatman cɛ li̱w kä ci duɔth ni jɛn kärɔaadɛ. Ɛ ɣän wut mi dɔaaŋ, kä mi wee wä tekɛ mi jek jɛ rɛy ja̱lun, dërɛ ɣä moc jiath lɔaac mi dëë ɣä dhiɛl ni piny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
